/w gm &{template:default}{{name=Loot Category}} {{[Weapon](!
#CatWeapon)}} {{[Armor](!
#CatArmor)}} {{[Gear](!
#CatGear)}} {{[Craft](!
#CatCraft)}} {{[Rarity](!
#CatRarity)}}


Table Commands
In this section, I will post the name and values of the rollable tables. It is very important that you set the “weight” of an item to the exact percentage in the name of the entry. For example, if it says “Sword (15%)” then you set the weight to 15. You can change these values yourself afterwards, since the “weight” basically means it’s percent chance to be drawn when rolled. If an entry does not have a percentage next to it (like in the weapon category table), all entries are set to the default 1 weight. If you change the percentages and weight, it’s important to make the total weight of all entries add up to 100.  
  
  







